1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,000
Same light, different color?

2
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:04,000
That's one clue to what you do next.

3
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:07,000
Amber or yellow?

4
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:10,000
Worth checking soon — no need to pull over yet.

5
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:13,000
Red?

6
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:16,000
That can point to something serious — pull over and shut it off.

7
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:19,000
Flashing instead of solid?

8
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:22,000
That often means don't keep driving on it.

9
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:25,000
Don't guess which light you're looking at.

10
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:28,000
Nick's Tire & Auto — we'll take a look, free. Link in bio.
